      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HANG TIGHT HONEY (4) hit the ground running and set it up early last time, clocking 22.34 with a 7 length win at Mandurah over 400m and making it back to back wins. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Looks the one to beat. LUCY'S DREAM (1) has been hard to follow lately, running seventh (28.66) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Mandurah. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. PANADERO DIVA (6) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by one length at this track in a handy 30.44 beating MARGI JEAN. Can measure up again. WEST ON PASH (3) racing over this distance brings the best out in her.",
